      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    closing_prices = [150, 152, 153, 151, 154, 155, 158, 160, 162, 164, 166, 165]\n    period = 10\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    multiplier = 2 / (period + 1)\n    ema = sum(closing_prices[:period]) / period\n\n    for price in closing_prices[period:]:\n        ema = (price - ema) * multiplier + ema\n\n    # Return the latest EMA rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(ema, 2)\n```",
